  "policy": "New Zealand is greenfield and has no incumbent population, so parity, export_surface, and target_surface are absent. Public NZ facts and Treasury oracles govern the build. MC15 weight quality follows the 2026-10-10 D1 ruling d1281: original-source household ESS at least 4000 and max/positive-median at most 5 block release; scenario-complete cell diagnostics are mandatory and failing cells are suppressed. Global ESS 16000 and the tighter cell support screen are tracked, never blocking. Fit and aggregate tolerances still await their Chronicle inventories and reviewed evidence; macro_realism waits on packaged evidence and reviewed bands. Donor support and release input coverage remain applicable and fail closed while their producers and checks are pending. Thresholds are never borrowed from another country or set from a candidate.",
